  m_text: 'is an exciting puzzle game that challenges your reflexes and strategic
    thinking. You will have to go through a series of deadly mazes, dodging rotating
    circular saws and solving logical problems to open the way to the finish.No room
    for error: There is no room for hesitation in this exciting adventure. Your path
    is limited - only forward! Every mistake can be your last.

'
